    },
    {
      "box": [
        72.0,
        156.63470458984375,
        459.33038330078125,
        195.23361206054688
      ],
      "text": "I suppose so. Anyway I hadn’t realised there are actually companies\nspecialising in creating theatre programmes.\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        72.0,
        208.0520477294922,
        112.34269714355469,
        227.55343627929688
      ],
      "text": "MAYA:\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        72.0,
        228.1547088623047,
        509.1820983886719,
        306.5926208496094
      ],
      "text": "Yes they are quite common nowadays. Contrary to what many people think,\ntheatres don’t hire people to do the programmes. In fact, companies buy the\nrights to publish programmes on the theatre’s behalf and then make their\nmoney selling advertising space within the programme booklet.\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        72.0,
        319.4110412597656,
        104.5427017211914,
        338.9124450683594
      ],
      "text": "FINN:\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        75.12000274658203,
        339.5146789550781,
        341.3392639160156,
        358.3135986328125
      ],
      "text": "It must be easier for theatres to do it that way.\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        72.0,
        371.2520446777344,
        112.34269714355469,
        390.7534484863281
      ],
      "text": "MAYA:\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        75.12000274658203,
        391.23468017578125,
        97.97940063476562,
        410.0335998535156
      ],
      "text": "Yes.\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        72.0,
        422.85205078125,
        104.5427017211914,
        442.35345458984375
      ],
      "text": "FINN:\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        72.0,
        442.9546813964844,
        509.1723937988281,
        481.6736145019531
      ],
      "text": "I remember reading something about programmes in early British theatre. It\nsaid that the cast was always very important.\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        72.0,
        494.4920349121094,
        112.34269714355469,
        513.9934692382812
      ],
      "text": "MAYA:\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        72.0,
        514.5936889648438,
        508.6148986816406,
        553.192626953125
      ],
      "text": "Yeah, audiences were very familiar with leading actors and big names would\ndraw huge crowds.\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        72.0,
        566.1320190429688,
        104.5427017211914,
        585.6334228515625
      ],
      "text": "FINN:\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        72.0,
        586.2347412109375,
        517.16259765625,
        664.5526123046875
      ],
      "text": "But I hadn’t realised that if the programme named a famous actor, that’s who\nthe public expected to perform. And if that didn’t happen, people accused the\ntheatre of breaking their agreement with the audience. They would demand\nrefunds and if they didn’t get them, there were riots.\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        72.0,
        677.4920654296875,
        112.34269714355469,
        696.9934692382812
      ],
      "text": "MAYA:\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        75.12000274658203,
        697.4747314453125,
        299.3393859863281,
        716.2736206054688
      ],
      "text": "Outrageous! That’d never happen now.\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        72.0,
        729.2110595703125,
        104.5427017211914,
        748.7124633789062
      ],
